{"id":"26d87d9e35a83cd9","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-conditional-function.md","title":"Conditional Function","display":"df-conditional-function — Conditional Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-conditional-function","aliases":["90-df-conditional-function","90-df-Cond"],"display":"df-conditional-function — Conditional Function","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-conditional-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-conditional-function</span><span>90-df-Cond</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-conditional-function — Conditional Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-conditional-function-—-Conditional-Function-$\\mathrm{Cond}$\">df-conditional-function — Conditional Function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cond}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cond}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cond} : \\mathbb{N}^3 \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cond} : \\mathbb{N}^3 \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (conditional function, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conditional\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\forall c,a,b \\in \\mathbb{N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Cond}(c,a,b) \\coloneqq \\begin{cases}a &amp; c=1,\\\\b &amp; c\\neq 1.\\end{cases}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conditional\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\forall c,a,b \\in \\mathbb{N}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Cond}(c,a,b) \\coloneqq \\begin{cases}a &amp; c=1,\\\\b &amp; c\\neq 1.\\end{cases}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cond}(c, a, b)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cond}(c, a, b)\\)</span>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c = 1\">\\(c = 1\\)</span> 则返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>，否则返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span></li>\n<li>条件参数并不假定只取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\">\\(0,1\\)</span>；仅值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 选择第二个参数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"abc082683aa1de80\" href=\"?note=abc082683aa1de80\" title=\"90-df-primitive-recursive\">90-df-primitive-recursive</a> — 原始递归函数类</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1fd3a0e014d33285\" href=\"?note=1fd3a0e014d33285\" title=\"90-df-composition-operator\">90-df-composition-operator</a> — 复合算子</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"88d284a5e496e4ef\" href=\"?note=88d284a5e496e4ef\" title=\"90-df-multiplication-function\">90-df-multiplication-function</a> — 乘法函数</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b769360437f9e54a\" href=\"?note=b769360437f9e54a\" title=\"90-df-successor-function\">90-df-successor-function</a> — 后继函数</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-conditional-function-—-Conditional-Function-$\\mathrm{Cond}$","text":"df-conditional-function — Conditional Function $\\mathrm{Cond}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"abc082683aa1de80","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[90-df-primitive-recursive]] —